# {title}

Proof of good standing and residency issued by your barangay.

## Requirements

Requirements and fees may differ by barangay. Check with your barangay hall before visiting.

### For the applicant

- Valid government-issued ID or barangay ID
- Proof of residency, if requested
- Purpose of the clearance
- Barangay clearance fee, if applicable

## Step-by-step process

Follow these steps to request a barangay clearance.

1. ### Visit your barangay hall

    Go to the barangay hall for your current residential address during office hours.

2. ### Present your ID

    Show your valid ID and any proof of residency requested by the barangay staff.

3. ### Complete the request form

    Provide your personal details and the purpose for which the clearance will be used.

4. ### Pay the assessed fee

    Pay the applicable barangay fee and keep the official receipt.

5. ### Claim your clearance

    Receive the signed clearance after the barangay verifies your record and residency.

